The KaTeX_*.ttf fonts in this folder are the fonts of KaTeX 0.16.47 (https://katex.org,
https://github.com/KaTeX/KaTeX), copied unchanged from the npm package `katex` (dist/fonts) that the
Kubuno Office web editors use, so the desktop draws equations with exactly the glyphs the web shows.

KaTeX and its fonts are distributed under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2013-2020 Khan Academy and other
contributors; the license text is in LICENSE-KaTeX. The fonts are derived from Donald Knuth's Computer
Modern fonts and the AMS fonts (American Mathematical Society, SIL Open Font License 1.1), whose licenses
permit this redistribution. The MIT and OFL terms are compatible with Kubuno's AGPL-3.0-or-later.

The data files in ../data (font metrics, symbol table, macros, spacing, SVG paths) are extracted from the
same KaTeX sources by ../tools/extract.ts and are under the same MIT License.
